{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a super easy multiplayer platformer.</strong><br><strong>So it's a 3D platformer, with online multiplayer and it's super easy.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>(Disclaimer: it's actually super difficult sometimes and not super easy. Some parts are fine though)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539680/extras/b4918b57e7a8c18991c9effac0d53eea.poster.avif?t=1769089380\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539680/extras/b4918b57e7a8c18991c9effac0d53eea.webm?t=1769089380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539680/extras/b4918b57e7a8c18991c9effac0d53eea.mp4?t=1769089380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mount Onmogelijk</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb to the very top of the super huge level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large, vertical level with multiple paths, varying in difficulty. Master each parkour challenge to climb Mount Onmogelijk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall down and... well try again I guess. Maybe you where lucky and able to save yourself onto a near platform. Or you lost hours of progress, who knows what'll happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539680/extras/6b2d895240ad0abba5961945b7f69ec9.poster.avif?t=1769089380\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539680/extras/6b2d895240ad0abba5961945b7f69ec9.webm?t=1769089380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539680/extras/6b2d895240ad0abba5961945b7f69ec9.mp4?t=1769089380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone, join the global lobby with up to 99 other players or host your own 5 player lobby for your friends.  <br>But let's be real, it's much more fun to see tons of players fall down... I mean climb up the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3539680?t=1769089380","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769089380","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539680/f2f5350e72f007af0d413e04cbd69d58df465761/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769089380","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539680/f2f5350e72f007af0d413e04cbd69d58df465761/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769089380","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3558700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a super easy multiplayer platformer.</strong><br><strong>So it's a 3D platformer, with online multiplayer and it's super easy.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>(Disclaimer: it's actually super difficult sometimes and not super easy. Some parts are fine though)</i></p><p cl